    "body": "Thank you for this work, and for the multi-language design.\n\nThe maintainer decided on 2026-11-22 to close this PR. It changes 589 files. A change of this size cannot be reviewed safely in one piece. It also has no linked issue and no priority, and it conflicts with `main`.\n\nYou are welcome to bring it back as a series of small PRs. For each PR:\n- Open an issue first, with the plan for that part.\n- Keep one concern in each PR, for example the language registry, the zh-CN catalogue, and the CJK fonts, each separate.\n- Refresh it on the current `main`.\n\nNothing in your branch is lost. It stays in your fork.\n",
